{"decision":"deny","letter":"We are writing to inform you that we are unable to approve your application for a conventional 30-year fixed-rate mortgage for the property you identified. This decision is final.

In reviewing your application, we considered your credit history, income, debts, reserves, and the requested loan amount in relation to the property value. The principal reasons for this denial are: your credit score does not meet our minimum requirement, and your obligations are too high in relation to your income.

You have the right to request information about the specific reasons for this decision within 60 days. You also have the right to obtain a copy of the appraisal report used in connection with your application. If you believe we have incorrect information, please contact us so we can review it.","reason_codes":["X02","C09"],"reasons_text":["Credit score below our minimum requirement","Excessive obligations in relation to income"]}

{"decision":"deny","letter":"Thank you for your application for mortgage financing with our bank. We appreciate the opportunity to review your request for a conventional 30-year home purchase loan for your primary residence. After evaluating your application and the information you provided, we are unable to approve the loan at this time.

The decision was made based on our credit evaluation criteria and was influenced by the following principal reasons: excessive obligations in relation to income and a credit score below our minimum requirement. While your employment history, property appraisal, and collateral were considered, they did not offset these factors sufficiently under our guidelines.

This decision is final. You have the right to request the specific reasons for this action within 60 days of receiving this notice. You also have the right to obtain a copy of any appraisal or valuation used in connection with this application, subject to applicable law.","reason_codes":["C09","X02"],"reasons_text":["Excessive obligations in relation to income","Credit score below our minimum requirement"]}

{"decision":"approve","letter":"Congratulations. Your application for a conventional 30-year home purchase mortgage has been approved. Based on the information reviewed, including your employment history, income, credit profile, assets, and the property appraisal, the loan meets our underwriting requirements. The property condition and marketability were acceptable, and no collateral exceptions were identified.

Please note that final approval remains subject to completion of any remaining closing conditions, receipt of any required documentation, and satisfactory verification of all information provided. If any material information changes before closing, the approval may need to be re-evaluated.

Thank you for choosing our bank. We look forward to helping you complete your home purchase.","reason_codes":[],"reasons_text":[]}

{"decision":"deny","letter":"We have completed our review of your mortgage application for a conventional 30-year fixed-rate home purchase loan for the property to be your primary residence. We regret to inform you that we are unable to approve your request at this time.

The principal reasons for this decision are: your obligations in relation to your income are too high for the amount of credit requested, and your credit score is below our minimum requirement for this program.

This denial is based on information in your application and our credit evaluation standards. If you would like information about your rights under federal law, including the right to request a statement of specific reasons for this action and the right to obtain a copy of any credit report used in connection with this decision, please contact us within the time period required by law.","reason_codes":["C09","X02"],"reasons_text":["Excessive obligations in relation to income","Credit score below our minimum requirement"]}

{
